  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5704.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5704.02 Scope. These rules shall apply to private school transportation providers and the public school administrative units, school districts, public chartered schools, or public academies in New Hampshire that hire them.\n\nSource. #12606, eff 8-17-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5700.html"
